LibRaw 0.22.2 public headers (libraw/*.h), unmodified, with LibRaw's licence files.
Source: Fedora package LibRaw-devel-0.22.2-1.fc44 (upstream https://www.libraw.org).
Licence: LGPL 2.1 or CDDL 1.0, at the user's choice (COPYRIGHT, LICENSE.LGPL, LICENSE.CDDL).

yaif only uses them for the struct layout: the library itself (libraw_r.so) is loaded at run
time (yaif_rawin.li) and must have the same major.minor version, checked at load.
To move to a new LibRaw: run ./update_libraw.sh, rebuild, run test/raw.sh.
